      "statusChangeID": "6398cd2db0662570360bd0f0",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "We added an in-game banner in late November! It helped make more creators aware of the deprecation of the legacy SDK.\n\nThanks for your suggestion. Let us know if you have any other feedback!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
