  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-11-05T21:36:01.061Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Forgive me if this is the wrong category for this.\nA lot of creators I've talked to are unaware that they need to all migrate to VCC in 2023, as they don't check the VRChat devblogs or the VRChat discord. Since VRChat now has a new in-game news and help section, with an unread indicator badge, they've suggested posting an announcement in that section to inform all players about the migration requirement. This \n in-game announcement should likely go out soon to give creators enough time to migrate and work out the kinks with VCC.\nFurther, it may be worth adding a \"creators\" section to the new in-game help and news to keep announcements like this organized.",
